      "realLife": "Polling is you standing at the door asking the delivery boy 'has it come? has it come?' every five seconds. Interrupt-driven is him ringing the doorbell when he arrives. DMA is him having the key to put the whole parcel directly in your cupboard and only ringing the bell once, when everything is inside.",
