        "<strong>Rotational latency</strong>: time for the required sector to rotate under the head; on average <strong>half a rotation</strong>.",
        "<strong>Transfer time</strong>: time to actually read or write the bytes once positioned.",
        "<strong>Access time = seek time + rotational latency + transfer time.</strong>",
        "Average rotational latency (ms) = 30000 / RPM — e.g. 7200 RPM gives about <strong>4.17 ms</strong>.",
